# JOURNEY · the Claw: one price a go. Read its paytable, pay, steer, and walk away before dropping.
# What the claw keeps is random, so the journey never drops: leaving mid-go forfeits the go.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /casino claw
expect Claw
expect a go
expect ENTER pay
key p
expect Claw#paytable
snap the paytable weighs every prize in the glass
key esc
absent Claw#paytable
key enter
expect ←→ steer
expect ↓ drop
key right 4
snap the claw swings over the glass
key esc
expect Leave the table?
key enter
expect ENTER sit down
key esc
